## 1. What we're building

The end product:

> **“Watch every movie/show in Bhubaneswar and notify me whenever a ticket category is ≤ ₹100.”**

It will continuously discover:

```text
Movie
  ↓
Date
  ↓
Cinema
  ↓
Showtime
  ↓
Format
  ↓
Seat category
  ↓
Price
  ↓
Availability
```

Then apply rules:

```text
price <= configured_threshold
AND
ticket is bookable
AND
we haven't already alerted for this exact opportunity
```

→ **ntfy notification**

