# 12. ntfy

ntfy is perfect for this because we don't need to build our own mobile notification system.

[ntfy documentation](https://docs.ntfy.sh/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

We can publish to:

```text
bms-bhubaneswar-deals
```

Example notification:

```text
