Awarapan 2

📍 PVR XYZ
📅 26 Aug
🕐 10:30 AM
🎟 Classic
💰 ₹99

Book now:
https://in.bookmyshow.com/...
```

We can also set notification priority based on price:

```text
₹100 → normal
₹75  → high
₹50  → max
```

