# 18. One important technical decision

There are **two possible implementations**.

### Option A — Crawl the visible UI

```text
Crawl4AI
 ↓
click/hover
 ↓
read tooltip
 ↓
extract price
```

This is easy to understand but potentially fragile.

### Option B — Discover the underlying requests

```text
Crawl4AI
 ↓
capture network
 ↓
find BookMyShow data request
 ↓
extract JSON
```

**I strongly prefer B.**

We'll still keep Crawl4AI/Chromium available as a fallback when BookMyShow requires browser interaction.

