# 19. Anti-bot / reliability considerations

We should design this conservatively.

We're talking about a personal monitoring tool, so there's no reason to hammer BookMyShow.

I'd use:

```text
30-minute interval
reasonable concurrency
randomized small delays
persistent browser/session where appropriate
caching
only request pages/data we actually need
```

And if BookMyShow changes its frontend/API, the scraper should fail gracefully rather than generating thousands of requests.

We should also respect BookMyShow's terms and robots/access restrictions rather than trying to bypass anti-bot protections.

